<title>NETHERLANDS: Triple P acquires Mediasystemen BV.</title>
<headline>Triple P acquires Mediasystemen BV.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch software company Triple P NV said it had acquired Dutch company Mediasystemen BV.</p>
<p>NASDAQ-listed Triple P described Bloemendaal-based Mediasystemen BV as a supplier of specialised editorial and advertising software for newspapers and other media businesses.</p>
<p>Triple P said the acquisition marked a strategic strengthening of its activities in the area of printing and publishing which it had identified as a core business.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
